(PANDEMIC - Demo Rulebook \(Board Game Cafe\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(OVERVIEW) Tj T*
(Pandemic is a cooperative game. The players are a team of disease-control specialists.) Tj T*
(Four diseases \(blue, yellow, black and red\) spread across 48 cities. The team wins) Tj T*
(together by discovering the cure for all four diseases, or loses together.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SETUP) Tj T*
(Place a research station in Atlanta and all pawns in Atlanta. Draw 3 infection cards) Tj T*
(and put 3 cubes on each city, then 3 cards with 2 cubes, then 3 cards with 1 cube.) Tj T*
(Cubes always match the color of the city. Deal player cards: 4 cards each with 2) Tj T*
(players, 3 cards each with 3 players, 2 cards each with 4 players. Then shuffle 4) Tj T*
(\(introductory\), 5 \(standard\) or 6 \(heroic\) Epidemic cards evenly into the player deck.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(YOUR TURN) Tj T*
(On your turn you do three steps in this order:) Tj T*
(1. Take 4 actions.) Tj T*
(2. Draw 2 player cards.) Tj T*
(3. Infect cities: draw as many infection cards as the current infection rate.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(ACTIONS) Tj T*
(- Drive / Ferry: move to a city connected by a line.) Tj T*
(- Direct Flight: discard a city card to move to that city.) Tj T*
(- Charter Flight: discard the card of the city you are in to move to any city.) Tj T*
(- Shuttle Flight: move from a research station to another research station.) Tj T*
(- Build a Research Station: discard the card of the city you are in.) Tj T*
(- Treat Disease: remove 1 cube from your city. If that disease is cured, remove all) Tj T*
(   its cubes.) Tj T*
(- Share Knowledge: give or take the card of the city where both players stand.) Tj T*
(- Discover a Cure: at a research station, discard 5 city cards of the same color.) Tj T*
(You may do the same action several times. Unused actions are lost.) Tj T*
ET
